        {
            "title": "First news of Kabitis 2",
            "date": "2019-07-28 14:37:48",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/3364670677190027867",
            "notes": "Hey players.\r\nI'm here to say that next month you can get some information about Kabitis 2. But, what I can tell you right now, is that the game will be for 1 player (at least in the initial version) and keeps the sidescrolling 2D style with redone gameplay system. Also, I am working to bring achievements.\r\n\r\nThat's it, thank you for your attention!"
        },
